Material Symbols
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Portal's unified icon set (`src/kit/mv-icons.ts`) embeds glyph path data from
Material Symbols, the icon library published by Google.

    Source:   https://github.com/google/material-design-icons
    Package:  @material-symbols/svg-400 (rounded style, filled variant)
